  by: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [F-4]
```

```mdl
decision D-26: The parity tests are copies of the portable echo-client end-to-end tests, run against echo-sqlite, and the echo-client tests stay unchanged.
  date: 2026-11-13
  by: user:dmaretskyi
  supersedes: D-23
